{"id":59222,"date":"2026-08-13T07:39:48","date_gmt":"2026-08-13T06:39:48","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-02T09:29:24","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T08:29:24","slug":"meia-maratona-guimaraes","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-guimaraes\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Cidade Ber\u00e7o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Cidade Ber\u00e7o 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona Cidade Ber\u00e7o 2026<\/strong> realiza-se na segunda-feira de feriado nacional, <strong>5 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica cidade de <strong>Guimar\u00e3es<\/strong>, no distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Promovida com o lema \u00abA Capital Verde Europeia Corre Contigo\u00bb, a prova tem partida e chegada no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Campo de S\u00e3o Mamede<\/strong>, junto \u00e0s imponentes muralhas do Castelo de Guimar\u00e3es e ao Pa\u00e7o dos Duques de Bragan\u00e7a.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O diversificado programa de provas contempla a prova rainha de <strong>Meia Maratona 21.097 Km<\/strong>, a <strong>Mini Maratona 10 Km<\/strong> e a <strong>Corrida 5 Km<\/strong> (todas com tiro de partida conjunto \u00e0s 10h00), seguidas da <strong>Caminhada<\/strong> de conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 10h10 e da corrida jovem <strong>Run Kids<\/strong> \u00e0s 12h00. As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais encontram-se dispon\u00edveis na plataforma da Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA Competi\u00e7\u00f5es), com abastecimentos e kit comemorativo oficial.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; backgroun